## 2. Vision

A.I.R.A. should develop from a conversational LLM wrapper into a trustworthy personal agent:

```text
Conversation
    ↓
+ Extract meaningful facts
    ↓
Validate confidence, importance, provenance, and permanence
    ↓
Store safely in semantic memory
    ↓
Prevent corruption, weak overwrites, and unsafe deletion
    ↓
Retrieve relevant memories
    ↓
Reason, plan, and act with grounded context
    ↓
Control tools, applications, the OS, and eventually devices
```

The intended behavior is not “remember everything.” It is:

> **Remember what matters, know how reliable the memory is, avoid temporary noise, and protect stronger memories from being overwritten.**

