## 11. Definition of success

A.I.R.A.’s current milestone is complete when it can:

```text
Understand a conversation
    ↓
Extract only durable candidate facts
    ↓
Reject weak or malformed facts
    ↓
Store trusted memories without damaging stronger memories
    ↓
Detect and manage duplicates safely
    ↓
Retrieve relevant memories with defensible ranking
    ↓
Supply bounded, useful context to the LLM
    ↓
Pass a full integration and runtime audit
```

That milestone is the trustworthy foundation for the later **Chief Agent**, **Computer Agent**, and **Personal AI OS** phases.
